class="js-section" data-section-id="UNESCO-World-Heritage-Site" data-section-title="UNESCO World Heritage Site"><div
class="relative border-t border-gray-100"><div
class="container my-9 lg:my-16"><div
class="grid grid-cols-8 lg:grid-cols-24 gap-6"><div
class="col-span-full lg:col-span-15 lg:col-start-2 xl:col-span-6 xl:col-start-2"><h2 class="text-3xl xl:text-5xl text-primary">UNESCO World Heritage Site</h2></div><div
class="col-span-full lg:col-span-15 xl:col-span-9 lg:col-start-2 xl:col-start-10 order-last lg:order-none"></div><div
class="col-span-full lg:col-start-18 xl:col-start-19 lg:col-end-24"><div
class="lg:text-right">
<span
class="flex lg:justify-end items-center">
<a
class="text-lg has-hover-animation" target="_blank" href="http://www.longobardinitalia.it">Read more</a> <span
class="ml-2"><span
class="icon icon--arrow-right text-secondary"><svg
xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" enable-background="new 0 0 24 24" height="24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24px" fill="#000000"><rect
fill="none" height="24" width="24"/><path
d="M15,5l-1.41,1.41L18.17,11H2V13h16.17l-4.59,4.59L15,19l7-7L15,5z"/></svg></span></span>
</span></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="container my-6 lg:my-16"><div
class="grid grid-cols-8 lg:grid-cols-24 gap-6"><div
class="col-span-full lg:col-start-2 lg:col-span-7 order-last lg:order-none"><div
class="prose-ground text-primary mb-6 lg:mb-12"><p><strong><a
href="https://www.scudoperlacultura.it/monumento/museo-di-santa-giulia/"><picture><source   type="image/webp" data-srcset="https://www.bresciamusei.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/unoscudoperlacultura-1.png.webp"><img
decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-108413 lazyload" src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAJoAAAD3AQAAAADN7nA+AAAAAnRSTlMAAHaTzTgAAAAcSURBVFjD7cGBAAAAAMOg+VOf4AZVAQAAAABcAxRDAAFoJQEXAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC" alt="" width="106" height="170" data-eio="p" data-src="https://www.bresciamusei.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/unoscudoperlacultura-1.png" data-eio-rwidth="154" data-eio-rheight="247" /></picture><noscript><img
decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-108413" src="https://www.bresciamusei.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/unoscudoperlacultura-1.png" alt="" width="106" height="170" data-eio="l" /></noscript></a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span
style="font-weight: 400;">Since 25 June 2011 the <span
class="post post-page current-item">Brixia Roman archeological area</span> and the monumental complex of San Salvatore – Santa Giulia have been included in the </span><b>World Heritage List</b><span
style="font-weight: 400;">, promoted by </span><b>UNESCO </b><span
style="font-weight: 400;">in the serial site </span><b>“The Longobards in Italy. The Places of Power (568 – 774 CE)”</b><span
style="font-weight: 400;">. </span></p><p><span
style="font-weight: 400;">The area in fact contained numerous traces of the early Middle Ages (pottery kilns, burials, modest dwellings) that testify to the long life of this area.</span></p></div></div><div
class="col-span-full lg:col-start-10 lg:col-span-15">
<img
decoding="async" width="1280" height="718" src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAABQAAAALOAQAAAADe2oMQAAAAAnRSTlMAAHaTzTgAAACHSURBVHja7cExAQAAAMKg9U/tawigAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAN4Aw50AAS7EnH4AAAAASUVORK5CYII=" class="w-auto lazyload" alt=""   data-src="https://www.bresciamusei.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/unesco-brixia-parco-archeologico-brescia-romana-museo-santa-giulia-1.png" data-srcset="https://www.bresciamusei.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/unesco-brixia-parco-archeologico-brescia-romana-museo-santa-giulia-1.png 1280w, https://www.bresciamusei.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/unesco-brixia-parco-archeologico-brescia-romana-museo-santa-giulia-1-768x431.png 768w, https://www.bresciamusei.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/unesco-brixia-parco-archeologico-brescia-romana-museo-santa-giulia-1-960x540.png 960w" data-max-width="1280" data-sizes="auto" data-eio-rwidth="1280" data-eio-rheight="718" /><noscript><img
