class="prose text-primary"><p>Discover the masterpieces of Brixia. Roman archaeological area with the EasyGuide! An innovative multimedia guide that is free, simple and usable directly from your smartphone! Access to the contents is immediate and takes place by scanning a QR code.</p></div></div></div></div><div
