class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p>With the <b>Integrated Ticket</b> you can visit <i>Brixia</i> roman archeological area with the republican sanctuary, the Capitolium and the <b>Winged Victory</b> and the four museums of the Brescian civic system: Santa Giulia Museum, Brixia romana archeological area, Pinacoteca Tosio Martinengo, Luigi Marzoli Arms and Armor Museum, Museo of the Risorgimento Lioness of Italy.</p><p><b>The Integrated Ticket lasts until 22 August 2027</b> and allows one admission to the archaeological area, one admission to each of the four Civic Museums, and one admission to the exhibition “Treasures. The Great Story of Brescia’s Museums”.</p></div><div
class="relative py-6"><div
