class="relative"><div
class="accordion accordion-744065 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-744065" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline"> Access for visitors with disabilities</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p><span
style="font-weight: 400;">The Roman Brescia Archaeological Park allows direct access to all areas of the museum (ticket office, Republican Sanctuary, <em>Capitolium</em>) thanks a lift connecting the different levels; the entrance to the Roman theatre is accessible from Vicolo Fontanone.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-744066 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-744066" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">Facilities</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p><span
style="font-weight: 400;">The following services are available to visitors:</span></p><ul><li><span
style="font-weight: 400;">1 wheelchair<br
/>
</span>(to be requested at the ticket office personnel)</li><li><span
style="font-weight: 400;">Accessible bathrooms</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-744067 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-744067" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">Accessible parking</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p><span
style="font-weight: 400;">The Roman Brescia Archaeological Park is located in the ZTL area (Via dei Musei) and does not have parking spaces.</span></p><p>To visualise accessible parking spaces closest to the museum, please check the <a
href="https://www.bresciamobilita.it/map#/mode=busRoutes/poitypes=parking/date=02-11-2021/direction=0/">Brescia Mobilità</a> website</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section
class="js-section" data-section-id="Services" data-section-title="Services"><div
class="relative border-t border-gray-100"><div
class="container my-9 lg:my-16"><div
class="grid grid-cols-8 lg:grid-cols-24 gap-6"><div
class="col-span-full lg:col-span-15 lg:col-start-2 xl:col-span-6 xl:col-start-2"><h2 class="text-3xl xl:text-5xl text-primary">Services</h2></div><div
class="col-span-full lg:col-span-15 xl:col-span-9 lg:col-start-2 xl:col-start-10 order-last lg:order-none"></div></div></div></div><div
class="container my-9 lg:my-16"><div
class="grid grid-cols-8 lg:grid-cols-24 gap-6"><div
class="col-span-full lg:col-span-14 lg:col-start-10"><div
class="relative"><div
class="accordion accordion-993614 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-993614" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">EasyGuide</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p>Discover the masterpieces of Brixia. Roman archaeological area with the EasyGuide! An innovative multimedia guide that is free, simple and usable directly from your smartphone! Access to the contents is immediate and takes place by scanning a QR code.</p><p><a
href="https://app.museummate.net/museums/ODUtUGFyY28gYXJjaGVvbG9naWNvIGRpIEJyZXNjaWEgcm9tYW5hIC0gQnJpeGlh/">Discover more!</a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-993615 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-993615" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">Bookshop</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p><span
style="font-weight: 400;">The Bookshop of the Roman Brescia Archaeological Park, located at the ticket office, offers a wide selection of books dedicated to the museum site, as well as a rich selection of <em>merchandise</em>.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-993616 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-993616" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">Cloakroom</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p>The Museum has a cloakroom area in with security lockers for storing personal items.</p><p><b>Cost of the service: </b>€ 1.00<b><br
/>
</b>(The 1 € will be refunded at the end of the visit).</p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-993617 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-993617" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline"> Refreshments and lounge area</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p>Visitors can stop for a break in a small refreshments area equipped with a vending machine for hot drinks and snacks plus a comfortable lounge area.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-993618 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-993618" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline"> Changing table for babies</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p>To facilitate the visit, the Museum has 1 changing table in the bathroom.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-993619 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-993619" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">Pets and dog-sitting</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p>Dogs are not allowed in the Santa Giulia Museum and its outdoor areas, <b>with the exception of guide dogs for people with visual impairment.</b></p><p>The <a
href="https://www.bauadvisor.it/lista-settori.php?id=museo&amp;nP=3&amp;city=brescia"><strong>Dogs&amp;Museum</strong></a> service is available for visitors. Thanks to the collaboration with <a
href="https://www.bauadvisor.it/lista-settori.php?id=museo&amp;nP=3&amp;city=brescia"><strong>BAUADVISOR</strong></a> you can entrust your dogs to expert dog sitters and visit the museum in peace.<br
/>
INFO: <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1d74737b725d7f7c687c796b746e726f337469"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="355c5b535a755754405451435c465a471b5c41">[email&#160;protected]</span></a><br
/>
From 15:00 to 18:00 call +39 329 1111586</p><p>Reservations must be made at least 24 hours before the appointment.<br
/>
The cost is € 10.00 per hour.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-993620 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-993620" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline"> Photos and videos</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p>Photographs with no flash are allowed.</p><p>Fondazione Brescia Musei welcomes its visitors to share their photos on their social media channels.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section
class="js-section" data-section-id="Getting-here" data-section-title="Getting here"><div
