</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><ul><li>by bus: check bus routes on the <a
href="https://www.bresciamobilita.it/map#/mode=busRoutes/poitypes=parking/date=02-11-2021/direction=0/">Brescia Mobilità</a> website</li><li>by subway: Piazza Vittoria stop + a 10-minute walk</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-991205 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-991205" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
