class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p><a
href="https://www.radiotaxibrixia.it/">Radio Taxi Brixia</a><br
/>
tel. (+39) 030.35111</p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-991206 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-991206" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">Car parking</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><ul><li>Arnaldo, Piazzale Arnaldo</li><li>Goito, via Spalto San Marco</li><li>Fossa Bagni, via Lombroso</li><li>Agip, Piazza Vittoria</li><li>Castellini, via Castellini</li></ul><p>To visualise all the parking areas and the ZTL areas (zones of restricted circulation) please check the <a
href="https://www.bresciamobilita.it/map#/mode=busRoutes/poitypes=parking/date=02-11-2021/direction=0/">Brescia Mobilità</a> website</p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-991207 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-991207" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">Bicimia</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p>Go to the <a
href="https://www.bresciamobilita.it/">Brescia Mobilità</a> website to discover this bike service</p></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-991208 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-991208" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">By Train</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p>Reach us by <a
href="https://www.trenord.it/en/">train</a>, then <strong>from Brescia Train Station:</strong></p><ul><li>on foot: 20-minute walk, direction Piazza Vittoria, then via dei Musei</li><li>by subway: Vittoria stop + 10-minute walk</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div
class="accordion accordion-991209 border-gray-100 border-t"><span
class="flex items-center cursor-pointer js-toggle" data-toggle-target=".accordion-991209" data-toggle-class-name="is-accordion-open">
<span
class="accordion__icon"></span><p
class="text-lg lg:text-base xl:text-xl text-primary block my-5 hover:underline">By Plane</p>
</span><div
class="accordion__body"><div
class="accordion__content"><div
class="text-primary"><div
class="prose"><p><strong>Gabriele D&#8217;Annunzio Brescia <b>Airport </b></strong><br
/>
(20 Km from Brescia)</p><p><strong>Orio Al Serio Bergamo <b>Airport </b></strong><br
/>
(56 Km from Brescia)</p><p><strong>Valerio Catullo Verona <b>Airport </b></strong><br
/>
(70 Km from Brescia)</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div
